    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「転校生さんも、すこし寝転んで休んでいかれるとよいですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「横になっていると、胃が活発になりますから。すこしは、『まし』になるでしょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「とはいえ、ベッドが空いておりませんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくし、普段は早朝から保健室にきてベッドメイクなどをするのですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「さすがに本日は、そんな気力もなく……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「自分が寝るところしか、整えておりませんでした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「なので、転校生さん。よろしければ、わたくしと一緒に寝ませんか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ちょっと、はしたないですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「どうぞ、ご遠慮なく」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/evolved/642"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ふふ。こうして、顔を寄せれば……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「どうですか。チョコをたくさん食べたので、わたくしの吐息がチョコの味になっているでしょう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「これが、わたくしからのバレンタインチョコ……ということで、堪忍していただけると幸いです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「……『ちゅ～』をしてもよかったのですけど、それはちょっと反則でしょうね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「顔が、近いですね。わたくし、すこしドキドキいたします」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「この気持ちが『義理』なのか、『本命』なのか、まだわかりません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「けれど、きっとそう遠くない未来に、わたくしは己の心を真正面から見つめられるようになるでしょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくしも、ゆっくりと変化しているのです。それが、とても喜ばしい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくしは今、きっと青春を謳歌しているのですよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
